"If you couldn't trust me, then it's because I didn't earn that trust. For that, I owe you an apology."

pt:
//【香奈枝】
<voice name='香奈枝' class='香奈枝' src='voice/mc01/0250630a03'>
//「あなたがたがわたくしを信頼できなかった
